Package: quickped
Title: Interactive Pedigree Drawing and Relationship Analysis
Version: 4.5.0
Authors@R: person("Magnus Dehli", "Vigeland", email = "m.d.vigeland@medisin.uio.no",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9134-4962"))
Description: A Shiny application for interactively drawing, editing and
    exporting pedigrees, and computing relatedness coefficients and verbal
    relationship descriptions using the 'pedsuite' packages.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/magnusdv/quickped,
    https://magnusdv.github.io/pedsuite/articles/web_only/quickped.html
